{"capturado_en": "2026-11-12T01:27:50+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Wild Warfare", "steam_appid": 312150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [315120], "detailed_description": "<strong>Survival of the fittest: now with guns.</strong><br><br>Wild Warfare is a free-to-play, class and vehicle-based FPS, starring a colourful cast of critter mercs. Inspired by old school shooters, it seeks to capture the fun and fur-ious action of classic era multiplayer games. There ain't no regenerating health here. <br><br>Wild Warfare is currently in Alpha. If you enjoy classic arcade action with well balanced gameplay, crazy characters, and bears with mini-guns, this is exactly that game. <br><br>Wild Warfare features: <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Class-based combat - nimble rabbits with bludgeoning weapons, raccoons with assault rifles, and more on the way! <br></li><li>Vehicle combat - Armoured Walkers transform the battlefield instantly with missiles! <br></li><li>Customizable characters - deck out your animal with warpaint, hats, and backpacks! <br></li><li>A bunch of game modes (Capture the Flag, Team Death Match, and Death Match)! <br></li><li>Ranking and levelling up - earn your infamy! <br></li><li>More of everything! This Alpha only scratches the surface of what's in store! </li></ul><br>No animals were harmed in the making of this game. But we encourage you to pick up the slack.", "about_the_game": "<strong>Survival of the fittest: now with guns.</strong><br><br>Wild Warfare is a free-to-play, class and vehicle-based FPS, starring a colourful cast of critter mercs. Inspired by old school shooters, it seeks to capture the fun and fur-ious action of classic era multiplayer games. There ain't no regenerating health here. <br><br>Wild Warfare is currently in Alpha. If you enjoy classic arcade action with well balanced gameplay, crazy characters, and bears with mini-guns, this is exactly that game. <br><br>Wild Warfare features: <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Class-based combat - nimble rabbits with bludgeoning weapons, raccoons with assault rifles, and more on the way! <br></li><li>Vehicle combat - Armoured Walkers transform the battlefield instantly with missiles! <br></li><li>Customizable characters - deck out your animal with warpaint, hats, and backpacks! <br></li><li>A bunch of game modes (Capture the Flag, Team Death Match, and Death Match)! <br></li><li>Ranking and levelling up - earn your infamy! <br></li><li>More of everything! This Alpha only scratches the surface of what's in store! </li></ul><br>No animals were harmed in the making of this game. But we encourage you to pick up the slack.", "short_description": "Wild Warfare is a F2P, multiplayer FPS made for players that enjoy fun and/or being a bear. It's a mix of crazy game modes, balanced classes, simple controls and intense matches. Its got vehicle combat, because why not? You can even be a bunny that clubs people with a wrench, lucky you.", "supported_languages": "English", "reviews": "“I am officially calling Game of the Year 2014, and indeed every other year, to the game that lets me be a bear in a bowler hat with a heavy machine gun.”<br>Rock, Paper, Shotgun<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/312150/header.jpg?t=1776884841", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/312150/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1776884841", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/312150/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1776884841", "website": "https://rocketsnail.com/games/wild-warfare", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows® 7 32/64-bit / Vista 32/64 / XP<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Pentium 4 3.0GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB